#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Sidralune {0} — an integrated astronomy suite for planning, observing, imaging and science."
msgstr "Sidralune {0} — eitt samlað stjørnufrøðiforrit til ætlan, eygleiðing, myndatøku og vísindi."

#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmur: IAU 2006 presessión og nutatión, JPL DE440 (SPK) ella analytiskar efemeridur eftir Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nhimmalljós eftir Krisciunas & Schaefer, sjónligir treskar hjá Schaefer, tríkantóbroytilig stjørnusamsvaran við RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstabling við kappa-sigma-, winsoriseraðari, linjutillagaðari og almennari ESD-vraking, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy við total variatión (Dey o.ø.), starlet-wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), almenn hyperbolsk strekking,\nlucky imaging við fleiri punktum, kúlulagað afturrotatión av ránstjørnum, almenn Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, gjøgnumgongdarmodell av Mandel-Agol-slagi við ensemble-MCMC."

